# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF，Windows 批处理保持 CRLF
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制/资源
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.db binary

# 让 GitHub 正确统计语言
*.py text
*.js text
*.css text
*.html text
*.md text

